

; ui chrome (docs/ART.md 11.3, 11.4): frames, buttons, bars and controls. Frames are nine-slice
; sprites: `: tags nine=L,T,R,B` gives the corner insets (art px); the edges between the corners
; repeat (`edge=round`) or stretch (the default; every edge here is uniform along its length).
; ui/ui.js draws them on a canvas (drawNine) and turns them into CSS border-images (nineCSS).

